B -- THE THREE REQUIREMENTS.  (i) bounded, (ii) Delta' > 0 everywhere, (iii) the Solar System screens.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THE LEMMA.  (ii) => Delta strictly increasing => sup Delta = lim_{s->inf} Delta = C, and
              Delta(s_gal) < Delta(s_sun) for EVERY galactic s_gal < every Solar-System s_sun.
              So (iii), which caps Delta(s_sun) at B, caps Delta IN GALAXIES at the same B.

  footing      binding gate B/a0   carried kernel C  measured in galaxies   shortfall (C/B)
