  alt                 3.8392e-05             0.6476                 1.190         1.687e+04
  [FAIL] B1 (i)+(ii)+(iii) are mutually satisfiable for the KERNEL ALONE -- some bounded, everywhere-increasing Delta both boosts galaxies and passes the Solar-System gates   (the carried ceiling C = 0.6476 exceeds the binding gate by 1.400e+04x (canonical) and 1.687e+04x (alt); against the MEASURED galactic excess it is 2.573e+04x / 3.100e+04x)

